  "_readme": "Two-layer token architecture. Layer 1 (primitive) is raw values. Layer 2 (semantic) maps roles onto primitives. CSS: --nil-primitive-* raw, --nil-* consumer. Components only reference --nil-*. Canvas, accent and the rest are defined in primitive.color below; do not restate values in prose, they go stale. Brutalist: 4px default radius (soft brutalist), 2px borders. Generated CSS: npm run tokens:build",
